    <h3><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/snigdharamkumar/">Snigdha Ramkumar</a></h3>
    <p class="project-topic">Digital Accessibility in AI-Assisted Software Development: Supporting Accessibility</p>
    <p>The project aims to improve digital accessibility for neurodivergent users by addressing the limitations of current AI-powered accessibility tools.</p>
    <h3><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fiona-gibb-023123238/">Fiona Gibb </a></h3>
    <p class="project-topic">Generative Artificial Intelligence for Midwifery Professional Development</p>
    <p>The project aims to explore how generative AI chatbots, like ChatGPT, can support midwives’ professional development by enhancing their learning, leadership skills, and career progression.</p>
    <h3><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abubakarsheriff/">Abubakar Mohammed Sherriff </a></h3>
    <p class="project-topic">A Multi-Stakeholder Approach to Quantifying and Visualizing Generative AI Bias in Higher Education</p>
    <p>The project aims to assess the use of AI in higher education to ensure its implementation promotes fairness, inclusivity, and equity, while identifying and flagging potential biases to raise awareness among stakeholders.</p>
    <h3><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kejia-zhang-80b967295/?originalSubdomain=uk">Kejia Zhang</a></h3>
    <p class="project-topic">Intelligent Tutor System for Children Using Generative Artificial Intelligence (Second Supervisor)</p>
    <p>The project aims to generate AI-based stories that support children&#39;s Math problem comprehension and derive step-by-step solutions.</p>
    <h3><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yinglow/">Niseraporn How Ying Low</a> (University of Queensland)</h3>
    <p class="project-topic">Designing for Accessible Everyday for Wheelchair Users (Second Supervisor)</p>
    <p>The project aims to design a system/platform to support wheelchair users work in hybrid environments.</p>
